[Desktop Entry]
Type=Application
Name=Flatpak Without X-Flatpak
Comment=No X-Flatpak key, so the app ID must be recovered from the argv by
Comment[x-note]=skipping "run" and its option flags rather than by taking a fixed index.
Exec=flatpak run --nosocket=wayland --env=FOO=bar org.example.FlatpakNoMetadata --app-flag %U
Icon=org.example.FlatpakNoMetadata
Terminal=false
